===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|brembel}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bræmbel}}, from earlier {{m|ang|brǣmel}}, {{m|ang|brēmel}}, from dialectal {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*brāmil}}, diminutive of {{m|gmw-pro|*brām}} ({{cog|en|broom}}).

